898
00:28:21,509 --> 00:28:22,832
That's your personal target.

899
00:28:23,182 --> 00:28:24,262
Question seven.

900
00:28:24,442 --> 00:28:26,057
Is it too late to start at

901
00:28:26,057 --> 00:28:26,741
