902
00:28:26,921 --> 00:28:27,200
No.

903
00:28:27,380 --> 00:28:29,568
You may not reach the same number

904
00:28:29,568 --> 00:28:32,088
as someone who started at twenty five,

905
00:28:32,088 --> 00:28:34,210
but ten years of focused saving,

906
00:28:34,210 --> 00:28:35,735
catch up contributions,

907
00:28:35,735 --> 00:28:38,321
a later Social Security claim and lower

908
00:28:38,321 --> 00:28:40,576
costs can make a big difference to

909
00:28:40,576 --> 00:28:41,637
your retirement.

910
00:28:41,817 --> 00:28:44,079
The worst choice is deciding it's too

911
00:28:44,079 --> 00:28:45,485
